Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.98,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fade(1002,0)\b1\frz18.9\pos(190,176.667)\frx12\fry316\c&H656664&}A Team
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.98,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fade(1002,0)\b1\frz18.9\frx12\fry316\c&HAFB4B3&\pos(415.333,63.334)}D Team
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:17.69,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Has she been making \Nall the shots by herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.69,0:00:20.20,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Prince powers unleashed, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:27.14,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The quadratic equation is written \Nin vertex form as y = a(x-p)² + q,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:29.13,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\fs8\frz18.67\c&H3F3A1C&\pos(513.333,243.334)}Mathematics I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:29.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,and its vertex is at (p, q).
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.13,0:00:34.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,From this, we can determine that the \Nvertex of the given function is (-2, 3).
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.43,Default,CLASSMATES,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:38.22,Default,MATH TEACHER,0,0,0,,C-Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:40.36,Default,BOY STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,That's our prince, perfect all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:41.78,Default,GIRL STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,S-So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:49.87,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.87,0:00:51.61,Default,GIRL STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.72,0:01:01.02,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.02,0:01:02.65,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.65,0:01:05.05,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.05,0:01:09.37,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,It just feels like you're trying \Nreally hard to distract yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.37,0:01:11.84,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,You're running your \Nprince powers on full blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.18,0:01:13.90,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What do you mean, prince powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.90,0:01:17.18,Default,BOY STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,What, you brought gyoza \Nfor lunch and not shumai?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.11,0:01:19.21,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Gyoza...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.89,0:01:23.97,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm going to go buy a drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:27.95,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Yep, something sure is goin' on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:32.64,Default,GIRL STUDENT 3,0,0,0,,Oh, not happening. I can't reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:34.61,Default,GIRL STUDENT 4,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, we need a racket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.82,0:01:39.63,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.63,0:01:42.54,Default,GIRL STUDENT 3 AND 4,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.05,0:01:47.21,Default,BOY STUDENT 3,0,0,0,,Hey, isn't she the one called \Nthe first-year Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.21,0:01:48.51,Default,BOY STUDENT 4,0,0,0,,I've heard of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.51,0:01:52.23,Default,BOY STUDENT 5,0,0,0,,Yep, gotta say, she definitely \Nlooks like a boy at first glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.59,0:01:57.34,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,These types of occurrences were \Nthe norm in my daily life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.39,0:01:59.34,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.82,0:02:02.58,Default,GIRL STUDENT 5,0,0,0,,Oh, hey. Isn't that Prince \NIchimura over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.58,0:02:04.35,Default,GIRL STUDENT 6,0,0,0,,What? Where, where?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.77,0:02:06.66,Default,GIRL STUDENT 5,0,0,0,,Oh, man. It wasn't him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:08.59,Default,GIRL STUDENT 6,0,0,0,,Oh, boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.49,0:02:12.88,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I can't hide my inner turmoil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:18.15,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Something inside of me has been\Nchanging ever since I met Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.51,0:02:24.83,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, I hate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.63,0:02:28.10,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I keep thinking, "This isn't like me. \NThis is stupid."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:32.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I blush every time I think about \Nthe things we did together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:40.41,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I start wishing I could erase\Nthe memories from his head too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.39,0:04:20.42,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:23.94,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,You're not gonna go visit \Nthe Prince today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.94,0:04:24.94,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.94,0:04:27.83,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,What? Did you do something \Nthat she didn't like again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:31.45,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Don't think I did, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:37.08,flashback,YOI,0,0,0,,Um... I didn't necessarily...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:41.77,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,, I wonder what would\Nhave come after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.69,0:04:47.96,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Man, this is the first time I've ever \Nthought about someone this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.42,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,The whole dating thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:54.27,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It starts somehow. You have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.61,0:04:57.02,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,And, well, then it ends somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:05:00.11,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wasn't it always that simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:02.44,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You'd think, "Oh, maybe \Nthis one is good."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:07.16,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Or, "This one is probably over." \NIt's all pretty predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.80,0:05:09.74,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No jealousy involved or strings attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:14.50,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,896)\t(2544,3440,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}There was never a time \Nwhen I'd get sappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.30,0:05:28.14,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.46,0:05:31.86,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I was pretty excited there, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:34.21,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,...chi. Ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.85,0:05:37.26,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Hurry up, man.\NLunch is about to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.26,0:05:38.94,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Why are you staring off\Ninto space like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:40.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:42.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.98,0:05:44.99,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:49.62,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:52.79,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Ichimura-senpai never came.\NWhat a bummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.13,0:05:56.35,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's not a bummer.\NIt was nice and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:59.17,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Sheesh, there you go again, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:01.17,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Hey, you know what I just realized?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:05.76,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,When you're with Ichimura-senpai, \Nyour prince side never shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:10.76,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh! And that's why she was exploding \Nwith prince power today! I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:14.99,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Yep, yep! When she's with Senpai, her \Ngirly side naturally comes out, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:16.66,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Aww, the youthful journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.79,0:06:18.27,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,101)\b1\fnArial Black\fs32\t(0,168,\fs24)\t(168,377,\fs28)\c&HAB5A2E&\3c&HF9E4D3&\frz24.26\pos(135.333,57.333)}Youthful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:18.27,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,The joys of adolescence!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:18.27,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,101)\b1\fnArial Black\fs30\t(0,168,\fs22)\t(168,377,\fs26)\c&HAB5A2E&\3c&HF9E4D3&\frz327.7\pos(510.666,68.667)}Adolescence
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.35,0:06:19.00,top,YOI,0,0,0,,C-Could you guys cut it out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.34,0:06:23.57,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh... Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.93,0:06:26.32,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to say it so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.46,0:06:29.62,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,No, we're sorry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:30.52,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:37.04,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm just not used to \Npeople calling me girly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.55,0:06:42.50,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It doesn't sit right, and \Nit's really embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:49.30,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,For a moment, somewhere \Nin my heart, I had my hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:56.07,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I never would have thought I was the kind \Nof person who would think like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:58.49,flashback italics,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,But maybe someone more \Nprince-like than you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:07:00.71,flashback italics,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,might actually be a better match for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.19,0:07:06.11,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Sis was saying that,\Nbut could it be true?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:10.25,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What if I'm just being \Ninfluenced by the first person
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:12.82,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,that happened to appear in front of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.40,0:07:18.47,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Would that mean it could have happened \Nwith anyone? Not just Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:31.63,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0.25\3c&HD0DFEA&\c&HD0DFEA&\frz353.6\frx12\fry10\pos(312.667,17.333)}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.29,0:07:33.43,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Do I know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:35.39,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,No, that can't be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:40.74,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,On the way home, let's stop by \Nthe new store that just opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:42.03,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.03,0:07:44.32,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:45.70,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Wha? You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:47.65,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you asked for more hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.65,0:07:51.24,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yeah... To clear my mind \Nof distractions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.24,0:07:53.20,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\fs40\bord3\c&H2425B2&\3c&H170989&\pos(318,186.667)}Distraction
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:56.55,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Does it have something \Nto do with Ichimura-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:58.05,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.05,0:08:02.09,Default,SECOND YEAR TEACHER,0,0,0,,Excuse me, would it be all right if \Nmy class used the library as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.09,0:08:03.29,Default,FIRST YEAR TEACHER,0,0,0,,Yes, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:08.23,Default,FIRST YEAR GIRL,0,0,0,,No way! It's Ichimura-senpai's class!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.98,0:08:22.37,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing, \Nlooking away like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.37,0:08:24.10,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,At least go say hi to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:26.02,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But we're still in the \Nmiddle of class, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:27.38,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,I suppose this is what we call fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:28.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, thank you kindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:30.82,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Been a while since you've gotten \Nan eyeful of the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:32.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Stop making it sound dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.57,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Did you wanna talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:39.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah, it's not polite to bother her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:44.00,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.41,0:08:45.72,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:48.37,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He usually pulls something by now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.26,0:08:52.71,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, I'm the one telling him \Nhe's not allowed to talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:57.80,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.25\fnArial Black\fs8\c&H000000&\3c&H5EFF84&\frz248.5\frx2\fry354\move(304,106,304,83,0,5090)}Frequently Tested Questions (Exam Prep Edition)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:57.80,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\c&HFFFEFF&\bord0\b1\frz344.6\frx12\fry356\move(161.333,117.334,161.333,94.334,0,5090)}Complete Collection of\NAncient Texts
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:57.80,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs12\b1\c&H35E6B6&\frz343.1\frx20\fry2\move(169,236,169,213,0,5077)}Questions
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:56.18,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Besides, we're in the middle of class.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:57.80,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:00.89,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Then, just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.52,0:09:04.27,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Maybe I shouldn't have looked away?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:08.23,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I know it's incredibly selfish \Nand self-centered of me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:10.91,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,To be honest...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:16.07,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I felt a little lonely and such...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:21.03,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fnArial Black\c&HD37347&\3c&HBC5348&\frz26.8\pos(210.666,142.001)}Mumble
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:21.03,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fnArial Black\c&HD37347&\3c&HBC5348&\frz320.1\pos(422.666,134)}Mumble
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:16.90,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Seriously though,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:21.03,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,why am I thinking about all this stuff \Njust because he ignored me this one time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:26.00,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I would have never thought this \N even for a moment before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.49,0:09:33.55,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Ichi?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.05,0:09:40.30,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\b1\fade(153,0)\c&H636F71&\3c&HEBF3F7&\fs8\bord0\frz9.537\pos(347.334,172.667)}New message from K-san
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:40.30,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(153,0)\an7\bord0\p1\fscy220\alpha&H20&\c&HEBF3F7&\pos(346,166)\frz9.146}m 0 0 l 87 0 87 3 0 3
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.30,0:09:40.39,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\b1\c&H636F71&\3c&HEBF3F7&\fs8\bord0\frz9.537\pos(338.001,174.667)}New message from K-san
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:40.39,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\p1\fscy220\alpha&H20&\c&HEBF3F7&\frz9.146\pos(336.667,168)}m 0 0 l 87 0 87 3 0 3
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.39,0:09:40.64,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\b1\c&H636F71&\3c&HEBF3F7&\fs8\bord0\frz12.61\pos(327.335,178.667)\iclip(m 382 156 l 391 164 423 165 412 150)}New message from K-san
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:40.64,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\p1\fscy220\alpha&H20&\c&HEBF3F7&\frz12.61\pos(326.001,172)\iclip(m 382 156 l 391 164 423 165 412 150)}m 0 0 l 87 0 87 3 0 3
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:43.39,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:55.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm getting distracted \Nbecause you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.44,0:09:58.41,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It feels like a parent \Nclassroom observation day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.79,0:10:00.15,Default,SECOND YEAR TEACHER,0,0,0,,Ichimura!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.15,0:10:01.66,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,My b.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.21,0:10:03.72,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Stop making me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:06.89,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.12,0:10:11.67,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Today after school,\Nwould you like to go somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.22,0:10:19.67,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I have work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.13,0:10:24.59,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:32.56,Default,FIRST YEAR TEACHER,0,0,0,,Okay, class dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.56,0:10:34.46,Default,SECOND YEAR TEACHER,0,0,0,,Second-years, we'll stay\Nhere for next period,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:36.49,Default,SECOND YEAR TEACHER,0,0,0,,so be sure to leave your things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:38.14,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Let's go, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:38.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:41.32,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't want \Nto say something before we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:42.16,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Nobara!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:43.88,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,She's right, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.82,0:11:01.05,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1\t(0,464,\fs40)\t(0,464,\bord1.5)\t(464,714,\fs38)\fnArial Black\c&HD193F3&\3c&HEDE1F8&\frz3.577\move(52,69.333,62,172,5,464)}Flutter
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.87,0:11:01.07,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Flutter...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.05,0:11:01.09,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fs38\fnArial Black\c&HD193F3&\3c&HEDE1F8&\frz3.577\pos(100,172)}Flutter
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:02.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:01.13,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fs28\fnArial Black\c&HD193F3&\3c&HEDE1F8&\frz3.577\pos(164,138)}Flutter
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:02.01,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\fs26\fnArial Black\c&HD193F3&\3c&HEDE1F8&\frz3.577\pos(187.333,128)}Flutter
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.01,0:11:03.85,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You better stop messing around, Sentaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:05.88,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Forget everything you \Njust saw, ya bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:05.88,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Sounds like something's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:08.28,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Puberty at its finest, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:08.28,top,SECOND YEAR TEACHER,0,0,0,,Ichimura, quiet down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:21.93,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Then. We'll. Go. Next. Time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.47,0:11:30.91,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Why am I feeling this way\Nwhen all we did was make eye contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:35.37,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai's sugar-sweet smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.00,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I kinda...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.63,0:11:38.54,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.13,0:11:50.90,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I guess he meant it when he \Nsaid he wasn't much of a planner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.63,0:11:55.02,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder where he planned \Non going after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.73,0:12:00.24,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Exactly when is "next time?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:07.20,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's been awhile since we \Nstarted this experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:08.65,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:10.98,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.95,0:12:13.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That girl. Could she be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.51,0:12:15.10,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Could you please let me through?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.79,0:12:18.71,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:21.94,Default,HIGHSCHOOL GIRL,0,0,0,,Oh... Th-Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.94,0:12:23.40,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Sure. No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.86,0:12:27.13,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:30.52,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He handled that in a very smooth, \Nsophisticated way, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:33.63,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He's the one from the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:46.90,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.60,0:12:51.59,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:55.87,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs10\t(0,1363,\fs9.5)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0.25\3c&HC8D0DC&\c&HC8D0DC&\frx20\fry342\frz12.23\move(267.333,20.666,270,29.5,0,1363)}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:54.77,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,{\i0}Huh{\i1}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:59.21,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Oh, you're here already... Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:01.27,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi is with you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:07.19,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh... Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:12.23,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.23,0:13:14.10,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,I didn't introduce you guys, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:17.66,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,This is Takuto Oji-kun, the new hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:18.81,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.81,0:13:21.22,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,And this is my daughter, Yoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:25.28,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.05,0:13:29.53,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,So, with that, if you have any \Nquestions, please ask Yoi, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.53,0:13:30.37,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.37,0:13:33.42,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, he's a new hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:34.00,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:37.46,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I'll do my best, and I look \Nforward to working with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.78,0:13:43.03,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,S-Same...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:46.38,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs32\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0.25\3c&HD0DFEA&\c&H81B8E1&\pos(261.333,218.666)\frx18\fry326\frz20.68}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:48.59,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:51.47,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,A vegetable curry and a chicken curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:53.47,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER A,0,0,0,,Oh... Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:56.09,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He's charming them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:13:59.23,Default,YAMADA-SAN,0,0,0,,That Oji-kun is pretty handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:00.68,top,OJI,0,0,0,,This one is the vegetable curry, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:00.68,Default,YAMADA-SAN,0,0,0,,Planning on starting an idol agency?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:01.81,top,FEMALE CUSTOMER A,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.99,0:14:02.05,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.05,0:14:04.99,Default,MIDDLE-AGED MALE CUSTOMER,0,0,0,,Now, I'd never say a person's name \Nis a reflection of their character...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.62,0:14:04.17,top,OJI,0,0,0,,The chicken curry is this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:04.99,top,FEMALE CUSTOMER B,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.99,0:14:08.35,Default,MIDDLE-AGED MALE CUSTOMER,0,0,0,,But he certainly {\i1}looks{\i0} like a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:08.70,top,OJI,0,0,0,,Enjoy your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:13.17,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,True. He's definitely more \Nprince-like than the Prince I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:17.96,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER A,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:19.83,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER A,0,0,0,,We haven't gotten the drinks we ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:23.00,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:26.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Here is the cola and \Nginger ale you ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.35,0:14:31.05,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER A,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:32.44,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:33.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:36.14,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER B,0,0,0,,You know, when you stand \Nnext to each other like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:37.39,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER B,0,0,0,,you look really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.98,0:14:40.36,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER B,0,0,0,,Like a double prince aura!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:41.80,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:43.39,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER B,0,0,0,,I'm serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:45.51,Default,FEMALE CUSTOMER B,0,0,0,,Watching you guys makes \Nmy heart flutter so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.51,0:14:46.53,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,That's very kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:52.74,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,People call you "Prince"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.74,0:14:55.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yeah... Because I look like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.95,0:14:58.37,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,People often mistake me for a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:00.91,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.22,0:15:04.74,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,People tease me a lot by calling me \N"Prince," so I understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:10.63,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,For me, my last name is "Oji," \Nso there's no way around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:12.64,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H2A2B33&\b1\bord0\fs15\move(211.334,150,100.667,145,3297,3589)}Oji
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.57,0:15:12.64,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H2A2B33&\b1\bord0\fs15\move(452,150,328.667,145,1797,2089)}Ouji\N(Prince)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.63,0:15:12.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:18.93,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Many perceive me to be competent and \Nreliable, when in truth, I'm not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.19,0:15:23.02,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,It really feels like I \Ndon't live up to my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:27.36,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But today, you were helping a girl who \Nwas being harassed by a pervert... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:29.79,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,What?! You saw that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.79,0:15:31.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, we were on the same train, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.35,0:15:34.57,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, man. That's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:38.41,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Even then, I let the \Nculprit get away, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.41,0:15:39.96,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,It was pretty lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.15,0:15:42.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:46.27,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I think you still looked very cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.75,0:15:49.73,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You're living up to your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:57.26,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I never thought of you as a \NPrince or anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.60,0:16:01.85,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I just thought you're a pretty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.85,0:16:05.56,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You know... You're really beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:11.14,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Whoa, sorry! I said something \Nreally embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:14.71,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Since I attend an all-boys school, \NI can easily spot girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:16.89,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, but not in a perverted way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:17.53,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.13,0:16:21.26,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:30.86,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Why am I thinking about him \Nat a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.26,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,Ko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.06,0:16:42.27,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,You should have told me you were home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:44.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I just stopped by to grab some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.57,0:16:47.63,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,Oh, my. You should stay a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:48.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:50.31,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.31,0:16:52.19,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,I got lots more again for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:54.78,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.31,0:16:59.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey, won't Uncle's store go bankrupt\Nfrom giving me so many clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.81,0:17:03.25,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,It's fine. He's pretty much \Ndoing it as a hobby, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:06.14,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,He says he likes dressing you up, Ko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.14,0:17:07.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:10.45,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,Besides, Ryu-kun doesn't \Nwear these kinds of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.49,0:17:14.31,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if Ryu-kun came \Nhome once in a while, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.31,0:17:15.77,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,Your dear mother gets so lonely!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.77,0:17:17.77,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. I gotta get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.53,0:17:19.87,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Say hi to Dad for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:21.59,Default,MOM,0,0,0,,Aww...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.56,0:17:25.06,Default,STORE CLERK,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.51,0:17:29.25,Default,UNDERCLASSMAN 1,0,0,0,,Huh? Isn't that the guy they \Ncall the second-year Prince?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:31.16,Default,UNDERCLASSMAN 2,0,0,0,,What? Is it really him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:33.55,Default,UNDERCLASSMAN 3,0,0,0,,He doesn't look like a prince to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:35.57,Default,UNDERCLASSMAN 1,0,0,0,,There's rumors that his \Nfamily is super rich, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:37.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, that's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.11,0:17:40.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,My grandpa's company is based in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.98,0:17:44.04,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,He had a super-smart ancestor \Nwith a bunch of amazing patents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:46.12,Default,UNDERCLASSMAN 2,0,0,0,,Huh? Who was his ancestor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:48.18,Default,UNDERCLASSMAN 1,0,0,0,,There's no way we'd have heard of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.18,0:17:50.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:53.92,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,His name was Thomas Edison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:55.61,Default,EDISON,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.61,0:17:56.67,Default,UNDERCLASSMEN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:17:59.55,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Just kiddin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:05.42,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Stop believing ridiculous rumors and \Nfocus on your studies, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.01,0:18:11.37,Default,UNDERCLASSMAN 2,0,0,0,,Huh? So, he's Edison's descendant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:13.38,Default,UNDERCLASSMAN 1,0,0,0,,Dummy. He was teasing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:19.46,Default,UNDERCLASSMAN 3,0,0,0,,But... He was kinda cool, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:33.72,flashback italics,MOM,0,0,0,,It seems Ryu-kun broke up \Nwith them, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.09,0:18:48.14,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.98,0:19:03.83,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\shad0.25\c&H24262E&\blur0.5\bord0\fnArial Black\fs10\move(231,74,306,74,0,7850)}Jyunshin Shopping District
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:57.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:18:59.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.29,0:19:01.45,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Seriously though, what a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.45,0:19:02.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Comin' from work?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:03.83,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:10.04,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm feeling strangely self-conscious from\Nthe incident in the library and earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:12.68,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.13,0:19:16.41,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,the second time I met you,\Nwasn't I eating Papico then, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.88,0:19:19.72,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:22.21,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.51,0:19:25.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I can't seem to forget it\Nfor whatever reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:30.15,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I clearly remember that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:34.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't know, I just can't fully...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.95,0:19:36.95,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,figure you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.91,0:19:44.53,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,That's something I \Nshould be saying to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:45.95,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? {\i1}Me{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.95,0:19:49.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm super easy to read. \NMr. Obvious right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:50.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Please. {\i1}You{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.01,0:19:55.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Never thought I'd end up\N dating you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.39,0:19:57.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You just never know how life will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:20:01.57,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Seriously, that's supposed to be my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.51,0:20:05.18,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oof, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:12.63,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What... should I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.01,0:20:24.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Y'know this year's summer festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:26.33,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wanna go together?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.06,0:20:40.82,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.43,0:20:44.83,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then, could you wear a yukata?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.83,0:20:46.06,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:48.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. I wanna see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:51.12,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I don't even own a yukata.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.12,0:20:52.17,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then I'll buy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.81,0:20:55.12,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wow, there's so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:56.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Which color?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.69,0:20:58.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Purple? Or maybe white?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:20:59.07,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.07,0:21:04.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm... Didn't someone say that \Nblack makes women look more beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:04.86,top,YOI,0,0,0,,I really don't need anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:09.79,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Just kiddin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.37,0:21:13.37,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Whether it's a school \Nuniform or work clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.37,0:21:14.73,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You can pull off anything, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:18.10,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Womanizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.10,0:21:21.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wait, what was that?! \NDid I hear you insult me just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:22.89,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I know you say that to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.89,0:21:24.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? What did ya say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:25.55,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Philanderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:26.68,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:28.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:34.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I wonder if there'll be a stall \Nwith those roasted corncobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.91,0:21:36.51,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's so good, don'cha think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.51,0:21:38.98,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Is he talking about grilled corn?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:41.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I hope they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:48.41,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Seriously, he's so irresponsible and \Nacts incredibly childish sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.47,0:21:52.85,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But when we hold hands,\Nit's surprisingly gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.45,0:21:57.40,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It makes me feel like I should think \Nhard about what to wear
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.40,0:21:58.71,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,to the summer festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.39,0:22:03.03,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The deadline for our \Nagreement is drawing near.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.61,0:22:05.76,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I wonder what I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:08.51,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,what {\i0}we're{\i1}... going to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:15.41,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur0.25\fade(529,250)\fs18\c&H39211F&\bord0\b1\fnComic Sans MS\t(4970,5387,\c&HFFFFFF&)\pos(351.334,237.999)\frz18.42}The Side of Me I Don't Know
